    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11336" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁπᾰλ-ύνω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>soften,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππου τὸ στόμα, τὰς τρίχας,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				4.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.5
			</span></i>; <i>make plump,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσχναίνω,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				50
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>make tender</i> or <i>delicate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς πόδας ὑποδήμασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Lac.</u>
					2.1
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be softened,</i> metaph., <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>4 Ki.</u>
				22.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ps.</u>
				54(55).21
			</span></i>.</div>
